note =========================================================================
note Mode 135 (kid 30): qPreGdnPrepL2Db -- Per-token Q/K L2 norm + decay/beta
note Args: QKV[B,12288] (R0:1), AB[B,64] (R2:3), Alog[32] (R4:5),
