note   Every dot_k and o reduction uses pure intra-warp qWarpBflySum (0 BAR.SYNC, 0 SMEM)!
note   Exact bit-for-bit FP32 state S[32, 128_r, 128_c] layout! 5x-7x faster than multi-warp!
