qLit 18 1
qIadd 58 58 18
qic 28 QZ 58 20 0 qCmp
put q36Guard 0 2
qic 46 QZ QZ QZ sub mGt get q36Pc 0 qAlu4
note Write final 16 state elements S[h, r0+0..3, c0+0..3] ONCE back to UVM!
